---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import EndCTA from '../components/EndCTA.astro';
import siteData from '../data/site.json';
import { generateAboutPageSchema } from '../lib/schema';

const title = `About Hector David Ramirez | ${siteData.brand.name}`;
const description = `How Hector went from a first job at a car wash to running his own hand car wash on US Highway 1 in North Palm Beach.`;
const schema = generateAboutPageSchema();
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} schema={schema}>

  <PageHero
    title="From the towel line to his own shop."
    lead="Hector David Ramirez has been washing cars for almost thirty years. Since 2019 he's done it under his own name, on US Highway 1 in North Palm Beach."
  />

  <section class="about-top">
    <div class="container-wide about-grid">
      <figure class="portrait">
        <img src="/images/about-hector-portrait.jpg" alt="Portrait of Hector David Ramirez" width="1600" height="2000" />
        <figcaption>Hector David Ramirez, owner</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="story">
        <div class="chapter">
          <h2 class="h-md">A first job at a car wash.</h2>
          <div class="prose">
            <p>Almost thirty years ago, Hector took a job at a local car wash. He was new to the country and looking for steady work, and the car wash was hiring. The pay was minimum wage, the hours were long, and the work was hard.</p>
            <p>He paid attention. He learned the chemistry of the soaps, which mitts were safe on which clear coats, which drying technique left spots on glass and which didn't. He learned the difference between a wash that looks good and a wash that is good.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="chapter">
          <h2 class="h-md">Running the place.</h2>
          <div class="prose">
            <p>Over the years he was promoted, then promoted again, until he was managing the shop: the staff, the supplies, the customers, the equipment that always broke at 7 AM. He understood every part of the business, and he knew exactly what he would do differently if it were his.</p>
            <p>He wouldn't compromise on the wash. Cheaper soap saves a few cents a car, and customers notice within months. Rushing the dry leaves spots. Skipping the wheels loses regulars.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="chapter">
          <h2 class="h-md">Hector's, on US-1.</h2>
          <div class="prose">
            <p>In 2019 Hector opened his own shop at 900 US Highway 1 in North Palm Beach. Hand wash only, walk-in service, and one rule: every car gets the care he'd give his own.</p>
            <p>Word moved through Old Port Cove, Lost Tree Village, Palm Beach Gardens and Lake Park. People could tell the owner was on site. The man handing back the keys is the same man who hired and trained the crew that washed the car.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="chapter">
          <h2 class="h-md">What hasn't changed.</h2>
          <div class="prose">
            <p>The rule applies to a Bentley from Lost Tree Village and to a contractor's pickup with beach sand in the footwells. It applies to a $19.99 wash and to a ceramic coating. The cars are different. The standard isn't.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <EndCTA title="Come see the shop." />

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-top { padding: 0 0 112px; }
  .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: start; }
  .portrait { margin: 0; position: sticky; top: 108px; }
  .portrait img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; object-fit: cover; }
  .portrait figcaption { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-slate); }
  .chapter { padding: 36px 0; border-top: 2px solid var(--color-ink); }
  .chapter:first-child { padding-top: 28px; }
  .chapter h2 { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-top { padding-bottom: 72px; }
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
    .portrait { position: static; max-width: 460px; }
  }
</style>
